# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing derived from a real bill belongs in this repository.
#
# The whole of data/ is excluded, not just the file store: the database itself
# holds parties, GSTINs and figures read off third-party documents, and the
# voice folder holds recordings of somebody speaking. Both are business
# records, and neither is ours to publish.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/

# Bills dropped in for reading, and the hand transcriptions of what they say.
# Anchored to the root: unanchored it also matched public/invoices/, and on a
# case-insensitive filesystem public/api/invoices/ with it, which quietly kept
# the invoice screens out of the built demo.
/Invoices/
tests/local_bills.py

# Recordings kept for measuring and teaching the recogniser.
samples/voice/

# Client documents that happen to sit in the working directory.
Scope_of_Work*.pdf
